  "articleBody": "A well-planned shower replacement starts with documenting the existing space, defining the desired layout, comparing waterproofing and finish options, and obtaining a detailed written proposal. Keep the shower location unchanged when possible to reduce complexity, but ask the contractor to inspect framing, plumbing, drainage, ventilation, and moisture damage before finalizing the scope.",
